        ],
        "text": "(1)    This code shall be liberally construed so that all eligible electors may be permitted to \nvote and those who are not eligible electors may be kept from voting in order to prevent fraud \nand corruption in elections. \n",
        "text_sha256": "591114e1b8c37c42c8e00ac42d508dbe14dd8456a09a9e47eb8dc7a0d9502778",
        "continuation_note": null,
