        "text": "(2)    It is also the intent of the general assembly that non-English-speaking citizens, like all \nother citizens, should be encouraged to vote. Therefore, appropriate efforts should be made to \nminimize obstacles to registration by citizens who lack sufficient skill in English to register \nwithout assistance. \n",
